% \item \cmd{\ForceName}\cmd{\ForceFN}\cmd{\SHAR} produces \ForceName\ForceFN\SHAR. \cmd{\ForceFN}\cmd{\SHAR} produces \ForceFN\SHAR. If we add \cmd{\CapThis} we get \CapThis\ForceName\ForceFN\SHAR\ and \CapThis\ForceFN\SHAR.
% \end{itemize}
